sequenceDiagram
    actor R as Receptionist
    participant M as ReceptionistMenu
    participant S as PatientService
    participant H as Hospital
    R->>M: Search Patient, enter name or ID
    M->>M: validate term is not empty
    alt term is empty
        M-->>R: "Enter a name or patient ID"
    else term entered
        M->>S: search_patients(term)
        S->>H: search_patients(term)
        H-->>S: list of Patient (exact ID match or name contains term)
        S-->>M: matches
        alt no matches
            M-->>R: "No patient matches the search"
        else one or more matches
            M-->>R: display ID, name, date of birth, contact
        end
    end
